\ A raise reached through a compiled word called in tail position at the top level. The
\ interpreter TCOs the top-level call, so no row names it; the eager boundary and the AOT
\ entry gate must elide the same row. The AOT suite builds this file through a `.source`
\ redirect and diffs the same golden.

inner: ( a b -- c ) [ + 0 + ] ;
outer: ( -- ) [ 1 "x" inner drop ] ;

outer
